{
  "width": 1080,
  "height": 2680,
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "三、绝不渡北的游击战与官僚大放水",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 90,
      "size": 48,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "font": "title"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "义军如野火燎原，但黄巢却立下一条铁律：【绝不渡过黄河以北】！\n这展现了顶级私盐头子的极高见识——\n因为黄河以北，驻扎着天下最恐怖的步兵克星：",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 190,
      "size": 32,
      "align": "center",
      "max_width": 980,
      "line_height": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "file": "b3a_cavalry.png",
      "x": 820,
      "y": 580,
      "height": 400,
      "anchor": "cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "『河北牙兵与沙陀铁骑机动如风！\n平原遭遇战，能把缺乏纪律的流民瞬间冲垮，\n还能一路穷追断粮，彻底追死！』",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 480,
      "size": 30,
      "align": "left",
      "max_width": 500,
      "line_height": 1.55
    },
    {
      "type": "rule",
      "x1": 140,
      "x2": 940,
      "y": 820,
      "color": "#EFECE6"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "避开骑兵锋芒，黄巢开启了史诗级的中原大穿插。\n但为什么数年围剿，义军不仅没被消灭，反而滚雪球般壮大？\n答案藏在大唐节度使们心照不宣的【自私算盘】里：",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 880,
      "size": 32,
      "align": "center",
      "max_width": 980,
      "line_height": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "『国家喜负人，事宁则弃之。\n不若【留贼以为富贵之资】！』",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 1050,
      "size": 26,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "rotate": -2,
      "font": "title",
      "max_width": 360,
      "box": {
        "style": "fill",
        "bg": "#F6A83C",
        "color": "#4A2800",
        "pad": [10, 16],
        "tail": "bl"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "『官军只保自家防区，\n咱们天地广阔任驰骋！』",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1050,
      "size": 26,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "rotate": 2,
      "font": "title",
      "max_width": 340,
      "box": {
        "style": "outline",
        "bg": "#FFFFFF",
        "color": "#2F2A26",
        "pad": [10, 16],
        "tail": "br"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "file": "b3b_warlord_slack.png",
      "x": 280,
      "y": 1400,
      "height": 380,
      "anchor": "cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "file": "b3c_guerrilla.png",
      "x": 780,
      "y": 1400,
      "height": 380,
      "anchor": "cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "rule",
      "x1": 140,
      "x2": 940,
      "y": 1680,
      "color": "#EFECE6"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "宋威谎奏『仙芝已死』，班师青州饮酒；\n百官贺表未完，贼众已连陷数州！\n朝廷以官职诱降，黄巢怒击仙芝决裂；\n仙芝战死黄梅，黄巢独领大军。\n一柄利刃，彻底斩断了招安退路！",
      "x": 80,
      "y": 1770,
      "size": 30,
      "align": "left",
      "max_width": 500,
      "line_height": 1.6
    },
    {
      "type": "asset",
      "file": "b3d_split.png",
      "x": 840,
      "y": 2080,
      "height": 380,
      "anchor": "cc"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "content": "『历朝流民军，皆在官僚放纵中越混越壮！』",
      "x": 540,
      "y": 2540,
      "size": 34,
      "bold": true,
      "align": "center",
      "font": "title"
    }
  ]
}
